  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Development - SAU/ODW</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODW and SAU wish to carry out a partnership development in Kampala, Uganda in August 2023. The partners have been collaborating since 2018, and wish to further strengthen the existing partnership and also prepare for the next stages, as the current project will come to an end soon. The main focus areas of the partnership development will be capacity building, organisational development and working with inclusivity. The concrete output will be strategy on how to strengthen the peer-to-peer methodology and approach in the organisations, including a strategy for working with inclusivity. First and foremost our fundamental goal for this partnership development is creating a strong foundation for a sustainable partnership and knowledge sharing.</narrative>
  </description>
